# Workflow Flows

Purpose:
  Project-specific flow definitions.
  Default system flow is in transitions.sdd; project overrides live here.

Flows:
  default: @default.sdd
  feature: @feature.sdd

Rules:
  [FL1] Project flows MUST NOT contradict system transitions.
  [FL2] Project flow additions require human approval.
  [FL3] Flow overrides MUST be documented with rationale.

